query: example.test
 names  certs [issuances] · sort first_seen desc
Keys (? or Esc closes this)

  enter              run the query; open a name's certs or a cert
  tab                names, certs, issuances
  esc                cancel; close; edit the query
  ↑↓ pgup pgdn g G   move
  f                  certificate: detail, text, PEM
  w                  write the shown certificate
  space              mark a row
  e                  export the marked rows, or all
  /                  filter the whole result
  s                  sort: next column and direction
  R                  re-pin to the latest commit
  ?                  help
  q ctrl+c           quit

The bar: a domain, or suffix:, exact:, ip:, contains: or regex:, then filters:
  issuer: org: issued-by: key: kind: status: valid-at: wildcard log: since: until: by:not-before
  Values with spaces go in double quotes: issuer:"Let's Encrypt"







